(4770936, 688991, 68546, '<td valign="top">Really good use of the numbers by the clues, it draws me into the shot a little more. I like the tone mapping in the shed it brings out a lot of detail in the wood. My only critisism of this is that it''s very weighted on the right with little interest on the left. I really like the window in the shot so the framing is good, but I would have just prefered something on the left in the setup that makes that part of the frame more interesting. Top 5 for me anyway</td>', 'Really good use of the numbers by the clues, it draws me into the shot a little more. I like the tone mapping in the shed it brings out a lot of detail in the wood. My only critisism of this is that it''s very weighted on the right with little interest on the left. I really like the window in the shot so the framing is good, but I would have just prefered something on the left in the setup that makes that part of the frame more interesting. Top 5 for me anyway', '2008-06-16 10:35:05.000000', NULL, 1),
