(4770997, 688789, 91282, '<td valign="top">I just started looking through the entries for this challenge, but I think I''ve already found my favorite. ;D I almost feel like the background should be a tad clearer, though. Otherwise, I love the shot and especially the concept. :) Great job!</td>', 'I just started looking through the entries for this challenge, but I think I''ve already found my favorite. ;D I almost feel like the background should be a tad clearer, though. Otherwise, I love the shot and especially the concept. :) Great job!', '2008-06-16 11:18:24.000000', NULL, 1),
