(4771006, 689066, 91282, '<td valign="top">Background is a bit too blurry... I didn''t even notice the guy laying on the ground to the right at first. The magnifying glass is a little blurry, too. The setup and the concept is good, though.</td>', 'Background is a bit too blurry... I didn''t even notice the guy laying on the ground to the right at first. The magnifying glass is a little blurry, too. The setup and the concept is good, though.', '2008-06-16 11:27:43.000000', NULL, 1);
