(4771015, 688810, 91282, '<td valign="top">Definitely a creepy place, and this is a good angle + good/eerie lighting. But not so sure it meets the requirements of a crime scene.</td>', 'Definitely a creepy place, and this is a good angle + good/eerie lighting. But not so sure it meets the requirements of a crime scene.', '2008-06-16 11:33:58.000000', NULL, 1),
