(4771906, 688104, 93883, '<td valign="top">I appreciate the simplicity of this photo and the attention to detail.  The composition utilizes the rule of thirds well, and you have created interest with the angles and the shadows.  I''m also impressed by how clearly you captured the print through the glass.  The only thing that bothers me is the color of the hand seems a little red, and I feel like a gloved hand may have been more appropriate.</td>', 'I appreciate the simplicity of this photo and the attention to detail.  The composition utilizes the rule of thirds well, and you have created interest with the angles and the shadows.  I''m also impressed by how clearly you captured the print through the glass.  The only thing that bothers me is the color of the hand seems a little red, and I feel like a gloved hand may have been more appropriate.', '2008-06-16 22:49:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4771915, 689079, 93883, '<td valign="top">Well, you positively mastered my idea on this one :)  I hope you''re not getting as DNMCed as I am because this is technically and compositionally very well done and also cute and clever as can be.  I have a feeling this is DrAchoo...</td>', 'Well, you positively mastered my idea on this one :)  I hope you''re not getting as DNMCed as I am because this is technically and compositionally very well done and also cute and clever as can be.  I have a feeling this is DrAchoo...', '2008-06-16 22:55:15.000000', NULL, 1),
