(4772180, 689017, 67237, '<td valign="top">OMG...I can imagine the kind of comments you are getting  ("what were you thinking?", "disturbing", and so on) ...I bet you are being crucified...I really think this is disgusting..but I will give you a 5 for the effort to produce it and an extra point for the guts of your model in helping you to do this...6<br/> <br/>I would feel guilty if I do not give at least some idea on how to improve this. My first suggestion would be to be a bit more subttle with the amount of blood. IMO you could have achieved a more artistic approach in the same scene was lit with much less intensity.  Mainly shadows (low keyish) with some indirect light in parts of the face and body could have worked better.</td>', 'OMG...I can imagine the kind of comments you are getting  ("what were you thinking?", "disturbing", and so on) ...I bet you are being crucified...I really think this is disgusting..but I will give you a 5 for the effort to produce it and an extra point for the guts of your model in helping you to do this...6 I would feel guilty if I do not give at least some idea on how to improve this. My first suggestion would be to be a bit more subttle with the amount of blood. IMO you could have achieved a more artistic approach in the same scene was lit with much less intensity.  Mainly shadows (low keyish) with some indirect light in parts of the face and body could have worked better.', '2008-06-17 02:45:13.000000', NULL, 1),
