(4777149, 688809, 73056, '<td valign="top">Wow, those are some boots. Nicely pressed jeans, too. Guess he prepared himself.</td>', 'Wow, those are some boots. Nicely pressed jeans, too. Guess he prepared himself.', '2008-06-20 02:05:16.000000', NULL, 1),
