(4778067, 688304, 93538, '<td valign="top">Would have been better without shoes to make it believable. Heels wouldn''t have stayed on. I''d like to see the shoes gone, remove the caution tape, and add a shovel with a half dug shallow pit.</td>', 'Would have been better without shoes to make it believable. Heels wouldn''t have stayed on. I''d like to see the shoes gone, remove the caution tape, and add a shovel with a half dug shallow pit.', '2008-06-20 17:26:50.000000', NULL, 1),
