(4780214, 688412, 19708, '<td valign="top">*grinning at the title*<br/>Was that floor spray painted like that? I see the over spray on the commode base and some on the walls. Certainly not the kind of bathroom I''ve seen before. Nice post-processing here too btw.</td>', '*grinning at the title*Was that floor spray painted like that? I see the over spray on the commode base and some on the walls. Certainly not the kind of bathroom I''ve seen before. Nice post-processing here too btw.', '2008-06-22 16:35:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4780215, 689058, 19708, '<td valign="top">I''d be willing to venture that this is not going to score well due to the political statement involved. Foliage on the right side seems a bit dominant in this composition though still a decent image overall.</td>', 'I''d be willing to venture that this is not going to score well due to the political statement involved. Foliage on the right side seems a bit dominant in this composition though still a decent image overall.', '2008-06-22 16:37:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4780216, 689043, 19708, '<td valign="top">Ok, this is a refreshing break from the serious side of the challenge. Thanks for putting a big old smile on my face with this.</td>', 'Ok, this is a refreshing break from the serious side of the challenge. Thanks for putting a big old smile on my face with this.', '2008-06-22 16:38:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4780217, 688230, 19708, '<td valign="top">Unusual shot not only due to the subject &amp; composition, but the coloration here.Not really sure the blue toning works best for the burnt logs, but does add to the color palette overall.</td>', 'Unusual shot not only due to the subject & composition, but the coloration here.Not really sure the blue toning works best for the burnt logs, but does add to the color palette overall.', '2008-06-22 16:40:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4780220, 688789, 19708, '<td valign="top">I like the way this was shot, especially with the depth of field used. It seems a bit busy in a way and at first glance takes a bit of studying to separate the fuel filler door form the gas nozzle &amp; bill. I think if the car had been a different color it may have helped. Good shot regardless, just my 2 cents input.</td>', 'I like the way this was shot, especially with the depth of field used. It seems a bit busy in a way and at first glance takes a bit of studying to separate the fuel filler door form the gas nozzle & bill. I think if the car had been a different color it may have helped. Good shot regardless, just my 2 cents input.', '2008-06-22 16:43:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4780221, 688920, 19708, '<td valign="top">Great tone and point of view here. Certainly a perfect candidate for b&amp;w. Hope your score isn''t getting nailed, (<i>oh bad me for that pun</i>) as religious shots often don''t fare too well. Good luck.</td>', 'Great tone and point of view here. Certainly a perfect candidate for b&w. Hope your score isn''t getting nailed, (oh bad me for that pun) as religious shots often don''t fare too well. Good luck.', '2008-06-22 16:44:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4780246, 688971, 67152, '<td valign="top">I sure wish the body was a bit bigger in the image - it is incredible hard to find him...</td>', 'I sure wish the body was a bit bigger in the image - it is incredible hard to find him...', '2008-06-22 17:46:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4780250, 689029, 64568, '<td valign="top">great shot, but I do find it quite disturbing and if that''s what you wanted, you nailed it ;-) 9</td>', 'great shot, but I do find it quite disturbing and if that''s what you wanted, you nailed it ;-) 9', '2008-06-22 17:50:06.000000', NULL, 1),
