(4781565, 688941, 5728, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the comments and of course the pretty blue ribbon. I thought I might pull ahead of DrAchoo on the ribbon count with this but he went and just had to get another ribbon too :) And to you who gave me the not meeting the challenge stuff, let your minds spill out over their borders now and then, you''ll learn to see a lot more in the photos you are viewing :)<br/> <br/>+++++<br/> <br/>I''m back.<br/> <br/>+++++</td>', 'Thanks for all the comments and of course the pretty blue ribbon. I thought I might pull ahead of DrAchoo on the ribbon count with this but he went and just had to get another ribbon too :) And to you who gave me the not meeting the challenge stuff, let your minds spill out over their borders now and then, you''ll learn to see a lot more in the photos you are viewing :) +++++ I''m back. +++++', '2008-06-23 13:17:08.000000', NULL, 0),
