(4781593, 689079, 5728, '<td valign="top">Nice one Sneezy... ribbon count 29 to 29 now? Give me enough reason to come back me thinx :)</td>', 'Nice one Sneezy... ribbon count 29 to 29 now? Give me enough reason to come back me thinx :)', '2008-06-23 13:39:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(4781594, 689060, 5728, '<td valign="top">Well you made that guy look pretty scarey... cool!</td>', 'Well you made that guy look pretty scarey... cool!', '2008-06-23 13:40:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(4781601, 688789, 93411, '<td valign="top">Well I will take my Personal best of a 6.2448 and 13th place.  I wanted to take a fun shot, the limited DOF was cause by a few things, I wanted to take the photo in the dark at a gas station, so I used my Fixed 50mm Lens with F1.4, which greatly limited the depth. It was the only way to use the actual lighting of the station and still get a clean shot.  Thank you everyone for your comments.  I know some don''t agree "gas prices are a crime".....Well it was an F-n joke, :-)  I just wanted to take a picture of something that was fun and people could relate to.  Thank you everyone again!</td>', 'Well I will take my Personal best of a 6.2448 and 13th place.  I wanted to take a fun shot, the limited DOF was cause by a few things, I wanted to take the photo in the dark at a gas station, so I used my Fixed 50mm Lens with F1.4, which greatly limited the depth. It was the only way to use the actual lighting of the station and still get a clean shot.  Thank you everyone for your comments.  I know some don''t agree "gas prices are a crime".....Well it was an F-n joke, :-)  I just wanted to take a picture of something that was fun and people could relate to.  Thank you everyone again!', '2008-06-23 13:47:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(4781640, 689079, 86316, '<td valign="top">This one was way too cute! I had to give it a ten!</td>', 'This one was way too cute! I had to give it a ten!', '2008-06-23 14:44:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(4781641, 688941, 86316, '<td valign="top">I had a feeling this one was yours!<br/>Solid shot as usual, nine from me :)</td>', 'I had a feeling this one was yours!Solid shot as usual, nine from me :)', '2008-06-23 14:45:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(4781662, 688971, 69008, '<td valign="top">Wow, You got trashed on this one.  I found long ago that in DPC voter land, you have to hit a lot of voters between the eyes with the expected subject in order for them to connect the dots.  Nice shot, and IMHO it fits the challenge nicely. It''s pleasing to see something here besides gory or fun stuff like cookie stealing. This looks like an actual crime scene.</td>', 'Wow, You got trashed on this one.  I found long ago that in DPC voter land, you have to hit a lot of voters between the eyes with the expected subject in order for them to connect the dots.  Nice shot, and IMHO it fits the challenge nicely. It''s pleasing to see something here besides gory or fun stuff like cookie stealing. This looks like an actual crime scene.', '2008-06-23 15:02:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(4781669, 688789, 94746, '<td valign="top">Congrats!!!!!!!!!!!!!  You your 6 and then some!</td>', 'Congrats!!!!!!!!!!!!!  You your 6 and then some!', '2008-06-23 15:10:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(4781885, 688941, 51538, '<td valign="top">A class act in this challenge.  Welcome back.</td>', 'A class act in this challenge.  Welcome back.', '2008-06-23 16:33:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(4781925, 689016, 27373, '<td valign="top">This is just a great image.  One of three tens I handed out in this challenge.  This is so very well done I don''t know where to begin- The "moodiness" of this if fantastic, dark, forboding, it looks like something from the beginning of a Cohen brothers movie.  The shoes make this shot pop, if they were black this would be an 8 (hard to believe two points for shoes).  My only very nit picky thing is the blood smear on the door should have been the right hand- at least I think so.  But, this should have been a blue ribbon.</td>', 'This is just a great image.  One of three tens I handed out in this challenge.  This is so very well done I don''t know where to begin- The "moodiness" of this if fantastic, dark, forboding, it looks like something from the beginning of a Cohen brothers movie.  The shoes make this shot pop, if they were black this would be an 8 (hard to believe two points for shoes).  My only very nit picky thing is the blood smear on the door should have been the right hand- at least I think so.  But, this should have been a blue ribbon.', '2008-06-23 17:06:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(4781943, 688941, 83785, '<td valign="top">This was by far my favourite picture, and is a true inspiration to amateurs like myself, absolutely stonking image!</td>', 'This was by far my favourite picture, and is a true inspiration to amateurs like myself, absolutely stonking image!', '2008-06-23 17:15:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(4781950, 689026, 83785, '<td valign="top">I am really encouraged by the fantastic comments people left me, including some personally well respected photographers.<br/>My first picture rated above 6.0, fantastic, thank you all!<br/>I hope I can continue with good ideas and learn from the many amazing photos that I see everyday.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-06-23 16:20:40.</i></td>', 'I am really encouraged by the fantastic comments people left me, including some personally well respected photographers.My first picture rated above 6.0, fantastic, thank you all!I hope I can continue with good ideas and learn from the many amazing photos that I see everyday.', '2008-06-23 17:18:12.000000', '2008-06-23 17:20:40.000000', 0),
(4781986, 688671, 85102, '<td valign="top">was this supposed to be a suicide?</td>', 'was this supposed to be a suicide?', '2008-06-23 17:40:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(4781990, 689017, 55212, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by RichMiller:</b></div><hr/><i> Why would anyone go to such creative effort to submit such a sadistic photo. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Did I miss a memo? Wasn''t this website created to showcase people''s creative efforts?<br/> <br/>I think it''s a fantastic picture!</td>', 'Originally posted by RichMiller: Why would anyone go to such creative effort to submit such a sadistic photo.   Did I miss a memo? Wasn''t this website created to showcase people''s creative efforts? I think it''s a fantastic picture!', '2008-06-23 17:42:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(4782050, 689017, 81530, '<td valign="top">This photo certainly deserved a better score. I gave you a 6.<br/> <br/>I think you could have gotten the same message without the knives, and the amount of blood is a little excessive. I also agree that the overall brightness of the image contradicts the sad/sombre mood of the photo. Other than that, I appreciate the work that went into this photo.<br/> <br/>The fact that so many people were turned off by this photo proves, in my opinion, that it is an emotional photograph, and did what it was supposed to do. Good work.</td>', 'This photo certainly deserved a better score. I gave you a 6. I think you could have gotten the same message without the knives, and the amount of blood is a little excessive. I also agree that the overall brightness of the image contradicts the sad/sombre mood of the photo. Other than that, I appreciate the work that went into this photo. The fact that so many people were turned off by this photo proves, in my opinion, that it is an emotional photograph, and did what it was supposed to do. Good work.', '2008-06-23 18:53:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(4782246, 688941, 7810, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by kiwiness:</b></div><hr/><i> Thanks for all the comments and of course the pretty blue ribbon. I thought I might pull ahead of DrAchoo on the ribbon count with this but he went and just had to get another ribbon too :) And to you who gave me the not meeting the challenge stuff, let your minds spill out over their borders now and then, you''ll learn to see a lot more in the photos you are viewing :)<br/> <br/>+++++<br/> <br/>I''m back.<br/> <br/>+++++ </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Yeah!!!<br/> <br/>Great shot Gary<br/>Congrats</td>', 'Originally posted by kiwiness: Thanks for all the comments and of course the pretty blue ribbon. I thought I might pull ahead of DrAchoo on the ribbon count with this but he went and just had to get another ribbon too :) And to you who gave me the not meeting the challenge stuff, let your minds spill out over their borders now and then, you''ll learn to see a lot more in the photos you are viewing :) +++++ I''m back. +++++   Yeah!!! Great shot GaryCongrats', '2008-06-23 21:38:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(4782252, 689064, 66384, '<td valign="top">I''m surprised I didn''t comment during voting, because it was one of my favorites in the challenge, and I gave it a high score. It''s very spooky with that light in the upper room of an otherwise abandoned house. The title helps a lot to identify it as a crime scene.</td>', 'I''m surprised I didn''t comment during voting, because it was one of my favorites in the challenge, and I gave it a high score. It''s very spooky with that light in the upper room of an otherwise abandoned house. The title helps a lot to identify it as a crime scene.', '2008-06-23 21:46:18.000000', NULL, 0),
