(4782792, 688671, 52285, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by got2bgutsy:</b></div><hr/><i> was this supposed to be a suicide? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>No, homicide.</td>', 'Originally posted by got2bgutsy: was this supposed to be a suicide?   No, homicide.', '2008-06-24 05:56:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(4782881, 689017, 9668, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by sklokke:</b></div><hr/><i> Did I miss a memo? Wasn''t this website created to showcase people''s creative efforts?</i></td></tr></table> <br/>Agreed, why do we so easily lose focus upon that?<br/> <br/>This image isn''t my cup of tea, but thanks for sharing. <br/> <br/>And one more thought - what is so terrible with being offended by art?</td>', 'Originally posted by sklokke: Did I miss a memo? Wasn''t this website created to showcase people''s creative efforts? Agreed, why do we so easily lose focus upon that? This image isn''t my cup of tea, but thanks for sharing.  And one more thought - what is so terrible with being offended by art?', '2008-06-24 07:31:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(4782915, 688941, 93760, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your award!It is very well done and certainly stood out among the others. I''m curious what do the beads represent and how did you come to name the photo Soviet Signature? Looking forward to seeing more of your work.<br/> <br/>Audrey</td>', 'Congratulations on your award!It is very well done and certainly stood out among the others. I''m curious what do the beads represent and how did you come to name the photo Soviet Signature? Looking forward to seeing more of your work. Audrey', '2008-06-24 08:13:58.000000', NULL, 0),
