(4785155, 688671, 39218, '<td valign="top">When people are asking if it is a suicide, I wonder how many people actually commit suicide with a butcher knife???  <br/> <br/>I would have liked to have seen some blood on the handle, and perhaps a hand smear with blood on the wall, with a more splashed effect that would be caused by a slashing death... the smear from where the victim grabbed at his own wound before falling...<br/> <br/>I love the perspective and it was the first pic upon reviewing the results that looked like an actual crime scene to me.</td>', 'When people are asking if it is a suicide, I wonder how many people actually commit suicide with a butcher knife???   I would have liked to have seen some blood on the handle, and perhaps a hand smear with blood on the wall, with a more splashed effect that would be caused by a slashing death... the smear from where the victim grabbed at his own wound before falling... I love the perspective and it was the first pic upon reviewing the results that looked like an actual crime scene to me.', '2008-06-25 11:19:29.000000', NULL, 0),
