(4787211, 687293, 68769, '<td valign="top">I have to admit, I was one of those that hade trouble connecting the title with the photo. But hay, when I went voting it was after working a 70 hour week, and the temps where over 100, ¾ of the time, which gives you a idea of common voters mentality ; p. I will say now that my skin has quit melting (well for today at least) I like the color version a little better (sorry), and maybe a title change to indicate vandalism would have you paying penance for momentary lack of sucking. Of coarse you could completely discount what was wrote and continue kicking my butt as you normally do! : )</td>', 'I have to admit, I was one of those that hade trouble connecting the title with the photo. But hay, when I went voting it was after working a 70 hour week, and the temps where over 100, ¾ of the time, which gives you a idea of common voters mentality ; p. I will say now that my skin has quit melting (well for today at least) I like the color version a little better (sorry), and maybe a title change to indicate vandalism would have you paying penance for momentary lack of sucking. Of coarse you could completely discount what was wrote and continue kicking my butt as you normally do! : )', '2008-06-26 18:59:26.000000', NULL, 0),
